 To change who has access, use `PUT /:account_slug/boards/:board_id` with the `user_ids` parameter.
+
+## Board Publication
+
+Publishing a board generates a secret public URL (`/:account_slug/public/boards/:key`) where anyone with the link can see the board and its published cards without signing in. Only account administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board. Publishing an already published board keeps the existing public URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`, with `public_url` set:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": true,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/public/boards/jdYKAoJpeRgdcYgPpwKcSyfH9MiKQmxmuza2",
+  "creator": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+    "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+    "role": "owner",
+    "active": true,
+    "email_address": "david@example.com",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. The public URL stops working immediately.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `200 OK` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`, with `public_url` set to `null`.
+
+### Public board pages
+
+The following pages are available without authentication for a published board:
+
+| URL | Description |
+|-----|-------------|
+| `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key` | The board with its columns |
+| `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/columns/:column_id` | The published cards in a column |
+| `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/cards/:card_number` | A published card |
